<title>HONG KONG: BZW ups call warrants on CITIC Pacific.</title>
<headline>BZW ups call warrants on CITIC Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it increased its issue of American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd, launched on January 8, to 170 million warrants from 150 million.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$39.70	 PREMIUM	 16.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.665	 GEARING	 6.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  08.JAN.98	PAYDATE	 28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$39.70	 LISTING DATE  30.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT THE OPTION OF</p>
<p>			 ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
